  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-DEstate-NPC26-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Each Frame is an impulse, an unconscious fragment of myself, and each seems to innately reflect the peoples who inhabit its Shard.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/QuestButtons/KM_Z00_CavityChamberVoid.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Dasein_G1_Wizard_NV-GALL_003.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1717127,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "",
            "m_nameOverride": "Dasein G1 Tung Ak",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "See? This Frame on the Stone of Heaven, as you call it, turned Tung-Ak's toxic dreams into reality. But it was reflex; I didn't do it consciously.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/QuestButtons/KM_Z00_CavityChamberVoid.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Dasein_G1_Tung_Ak_NV-GALL_001.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "",
            "m_nameOverride": "Dasein G1 Maulwurf",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I wanted to join the Spiral, to become a new thing in the Everything. I blended shapes and magic to create what I wanted to be: something for everyone.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/QuestButtons/KM_Z00_CavityChamberVoid.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Dasein_G1_Maulwurf_NV-GALL_001.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "",
            "m_nameOverride": "Dasein G1 Copy Qhat",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I think this is why the World Synthesizer fragmented me so: everyone wants something different. And in this fragmented state, I am weakened.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/QuestButtons/KM_Z00_CavityChamberVoid.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Dasein_G1_Copy_Qhat_NV-GALL_001.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "",
            "m_nameOverride": "Dasein G1 Judge Veg",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I feel the other Shards, but can't see or control them. They are contorted by contradictory whims and thus I am twisted into incompatible shapes.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/QuestButtons/KM_Z00_CavityChamberVoid.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Dasein_G1_Judge_Veg_NV-GALL_001.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "",
            "m_nameOverride": "Dasein G1 Quake Charmer",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "These exertions are straining me, these quiet tensions cause... stress, which manifests as creatures, monsters, enemies.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/QuestButtons/KM_Z00_CavityChamberVoid.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Dasein_G1_Quake_Charmer_NV-GALL_001.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "",
            "m_nameOverride": "Dasein G1 Nana",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Help me expand my Frame of Mind. Open Frames on other Shards to connect me to myself, strengthening me - mind and body - to deny evil wants.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/QuestButtons/KM_Z00_CavityChamberVoid.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Dasein_G1_Nana_NV-GALL_001.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-DEstate-NPC26-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I wish to join the Everything, Wizard, but right now the Everything is tearing me apart. Please... help me.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/QuestButtons/KM_Z00_CavityChamberVoid.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Dasein_G1_Wizard_NV-GALL_004.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1717127,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-CON-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I took Tung-Ak back to Catmandu and returned to find you staring blankly at this... thing.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cow_Ronin_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Moo_Bu_NV-GALL_127.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1546271,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-CON-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Also, the sky changed. Seem to be more of those breaches Tung-Ak was using to attack Catmandu... but they're looking toward Conatus? What happened?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cow_Ronin_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Moo_Bu_NV-GALL_128.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1546271,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-CON-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Frame of Mind, huh? And now you need to find more? Maybe the people in Conatus can guide you there. Wish I could help...",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cow_Ronin_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Moo_Bu_NV-GALL_129.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1546271,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-CON-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "...But Catmandu's in rough shape. I think I need to help them rebuild. As they would say, our strings disentangle here.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cow_Ronin_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Moo_Bu_NV-GALL_130.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1546271,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-CON-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Unless you want to come down and lend a hand. Otherwise, thank you, Wizard, for showing an old warrior there are still adventures to be had.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cow_Ronin_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Moo_Bu_NV-GALL_131.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1546271,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-CON-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Marleybone, Polaris, Monquista and Valencia have all gathered in that large tent to discuss permanent settlement!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_MonkF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/String_Caster_Fuzhi_NV-GALL_036.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1546270,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
